      "notes": "Please Remain Dead is a horror game set in a fictional mortuary examination room. You play a living person, strapped to a table under a sheet, who has to pass as a corpse while an examiner checks the body. It includes: being restrained and examined while helpless; the threat of being incinerated alive; post-mortem instruments (scalpel, forceps, rib shears, a bone saw) laid out beside you, and a cut line drawn on the sheet over your chest; an unexplained organism breathing inside the body; tense sound design including breathing, gasping and a scream; and a violent death if you are caught, in which the examiner attacks you with a hammer. The strikes are shown without gore, and the screen cuts to black on impact. There is no surgery shown, no nudity or sexual content, and no drug use or self-harm. Options include reduced flashes, reduced camera movement and a Less Annoying Sounds Mode."
